      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NFR:\n- High availability for reads\n- Eventual consistency for bank sync\n- No lost or duplicate transactions\n- Secure financial data\n- Scale to millions of users / transactions\n- Low-latency transaction and analytics reads\n- Tolerate bank API failures and rate limits",
